<div class="page">
  <h2 style="font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 20px;">Logging into UAH services</h2>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6;">
    <li>
      Your <strong style="font-weight: bold;">Charger ID</strong> is the first part of your primary UAH email address.
      <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 5px;">
        <li>Charger ID: <span data-field="charger_id_example">{{ charger_id_example }}</span></li>
        <li>UAH email address: <span data-field="uah_email_example">{{ uah_email_example }}</span></li>
      </ul>
    </li>
    <li>
      To log in to your UAH email account or the eduroam wireless network, your <strong style="font-weight: bold;">UAH email address</strong> is the username.
    </li>
    <li>
      To log in to myUAH, Canvas, Banner, or any other SSO-enabled services, your <strong style="font-weight: bold;">Charger ID</strong> is the username.
