<div class="page">
  <h1>Add cell phone number</h1>
  <ul>
    <li>Be sure to verify that a mobile phone number for you has been stored.</li>
    <li>It must be defined with a Phone Type of Cell.</li>
  </ul>
  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 20px; width: 450px;">
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 15px;">
        <h3 style="margin: 0;">Add Phone Number</h3>
        <span style="cursor: pointer;">&times;</span>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
        <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">Phone Type</label>
        <select style="width: 100%; padding: 8px;">
          <option>Cell</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
        <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">Phone Number</label>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 10px;">
          <input type="text" style="flex: 2; padding: 8px;">
          <input type="text" style="flex: 2; padding: 8px;">
          <input type="text" style="flex: 1; padding: 8px;">
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
        <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">International Access Code and Phone Number</label>
        <input type="text" style="width: 100%; padding: 8px;">
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
        <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">International Phone Number</label>
        <input type="text" style="width: 100%; padding: 8px;">
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">
          <input type="radio" name="radio1" checked> Primary
          <input type="radio" name="radio1"> Unlisted
        </label>
      </div>
      <button style="width: 100%; padding: 10px; background-color: #007bff; color: white; border: none; cursor: pointer;">Add</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top: 50px; text-align: center; font-size: small; color: #666;">
    <span data-field="contact.email">{{ contact.email }}</span> | <span data-field="contact.phone">{{ contact.phone }}</span> | <span data-field="contact.website">{{ contact.website }}</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h1>Add non-UAH email address</h1>
  <ul>
    <li>Be sure to verify that an alternate, non-UAH email address for you has been stored.</li>
    <li>It must be defined with an Email Type of Personal.</li>
  </ul>
  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 20px; width: 450px;">
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 15px;">
        <h3 style="margin: 0;">Add Email</h3>
        <span style="cursor: pointer;">&times;</span>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
        <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">Email Type</label>
        <select style="width: 100%; padding: 8px;">
          <option>Personal Email</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
        <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">Email Address</label>
        <input type="text" style="width: 100%; padding: 8px;">
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
        <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">Comments</label>
        <input type="text" style="width: 100%; padding: 8px;">
      </div>
      <button style="width: 100%; padding: 10px; background-color: #007bff; color: white; border: none; cursor: pointer;">Add</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top: 50px; text-align: center; font-size: small; color: #666;">
    <span data-field="contact.email">{{ contact.email }}</span> | <span data-field="contact.phone">{{ contact.phone }}</span> | <span data-field="contact.website">{{ contact.website }}</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h1>Update Security Questions</h1>
  <ol>
    <li>On the Personal Information page, click the 4-squares icon in the top left.</li>
    <li>Select Banner > Personal Information > Change Security Question.</li>
  </ol>
  <div style="margin-top: 30px; display: flex; gap: 40px;">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <img src="placeholder_icon.png" alt="Personal Information Icon" style="max-width: 100px; height: auto;">
      <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px; margin-top: 10px;">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
          <span data-field="menu.personal_info">{{ menu.personal_info }}</span>
          <span data-field="menu.icon">{{ menu.icon }}</span>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
          <span data-field="menu.personal_detail">{{ menu.personal_detail }}</span>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
          <span data-field="menu.change_security_question">{{ menu.change_security_question }}</span>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
          <span data-field="menu.name_change_info">{{ menu.name_change_info }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <img src="placeholder_screenshot.png" alt="Screenshot" style="width: 100%; height: auto;">
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h1>Update Security Questions</h1>
  <ol start="3">
    <li>Enter your current UAH password where prompted to Confirm Your Password/PIN.</li>
    <li>Choose a question from the list and Submit an answer.</li>
    <li>Capitalization, spaces, and punctuation matter; the <strong style="color: red;">answers are case-sensitive</strong>.</li>
    <li>When you have answered all 5 questions, you will receive a notification that Your changes were saved successfully.</li>
  </ol>
  <div style="margin-top: 30px; display: flex; gap: 40px;">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <img src="placeholder_screenshot_2.png" alt="Screenshot 2" style="width: 100%; height: auto;">
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 20px;">
        <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
          <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">Question 1 of 5.</label>
          <select style="width: 100%; padding: 8px;">
            <option>Question</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
          <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">Answer:</label>
          <input type="text" style="width: 100%; padding: 8px;">
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 10px;">
          <button style="padding: 8px; background-color: #ccc;">Submit</button>
          <button style="padding: 8px; background-color: #ccc;">Reset</button>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 20px; font-size: small; color: #666;">
          RELEASE: <span data-field="release_version">{{ release_version }}</span>
        </div>
        <div style="font-size: small; color: #666; margin-top: 5px;">
          &copy; <span data-field="copyright_year">{{ copyright_year }}</span> <span data-field="copyright_holder">{{ copyright_holder }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

